The Nix packaging expressions in pkgs/brave/ are based on the Nixpkgs
Brave package directory:
https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/tree/nixos-unstable/pkgs/applications/networking/browsers/brave

The Brave Browser and Brave Origin binaries are not included in this
repository. They are fetched from Brave's official release URLs at build time.
Brave's binaries and trademarks are subject to Brave's own terms and licenses.
